 ## Background
-This method is part of the "vis-magnus-2018" project, an unofficial implementation of a volume rendering algorithm [S1, unofficial]. The specific compute shader for gradient computation and light propagation is designed to integrate with a Vulkan-based rendering pipeline, utilizing descriptor sets, push constants, and compute shaders for efficient processing [S1, unofficial].
